@startuml
title Smart Housing Services - System Context

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Resident" as Resident
actor "Dispatcher" as Dispatcher
actor "Service Staff" as Staff

rectangle "Smart Housing Services\nWeb application prototype" as System

Resident --> System : Submit requests\nView own requests and statuses
Dispatcher --> System : Review classifications\nConfirm or correct assignments
Staff --> System : View assigned requests\nUpdate processing statuses

note bottom of System
  Classifies request text and recommends
  services from a demonstration directory.

  A dispatcher confirms assignments.
  No production municipal integration
  is included in the initial prototype.
end note

@enduml
